          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Enhanced workflow</span><br>\nThis tool integrates seamlessly into the current workflow and puts you in control.</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Post-op communication<br>\n </span>Connect on a different level with patients – the pre-op and post-op comparison images deliver confidence that the pathology was addressed appropriately.</p>\n",
